# Smart India Hackathon: AlumniConnect Full-Stack Cheat Sheet

This guide is designed to help you understand every component of your full-stack application (frontend and backend) so you can confidently answer any technical questions from the hackathon judges.

---

## 🛠️ The Tech Stack (What we used)

### Frontend (Client-Side)
| Technology | What it is | Why we chose it (The "Pitch") |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **React 18** | UI Library | Component-based architecture allows for highly reusable, maintainable UI code and a lightning-fast virtual DOM. |
| **Vite** | Build Tool & Bundler | Outperforms older bundlers like Create-React-App/Webpack. It provides near-instant server start and extremely fast hot-module replacement (HMR). |
| **React Router v6** | Client-Side Routing | Enables single-page application (SPA) navigation without reloading the browser page, providing a native app-like experience. |
| **Axios** | HTTP Client | Simplifies making API requests to our backend with built-in JSON parsing, request interception, and robust error handling. |
| **Vanilla CSS** | Styling | We wrote custom CSS from scratch to maintain maximum control over the highly customized, responsive, and aesthetic design without the overhead of heavy UI frameworks. |
| **Jitsi React SDK** | Video Conferencing | Enables seamless, secure, open-source video calling directly in the browser for alumni-student mentorship sessions. |

### Backend (Server-Side)
| Technology | What it is | Why we chose it (The "Pitch") |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Python 3** | Programming Language | Offers clean syntax, massive community support, and rapid development speeds. |
| **FastAPI** | Web Framework | High-performance API framework that uses asynchronous (`async/await`) code out of the box. It automatically generates interactive **Swagger UI** documentation. |
| **Uvicorn** | ASGI Web Server | The lightning-fast engine that runs our FastAPI application in production. |
| **SQLAlchemy (Async)** | ORM (Object-Relational Mapper) | Allows us to write database queries using Python code instead of raw SQL, with full asynchronous support to prevent the database from blocking the server. |
| **PostgreSQL (Supabase)** | Relational Database | The most secure, enterprise-grade open-source SQL database. Hosted on **Supabase** for zero-maintenance cloud database hosting. |

### DevOps & Infrastructure
| Technology | What it is | Why we chose it |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Railway** | Cloud Hosting (PaaS) | Automatically pulls our latest code from GitHub, builds it, and deploys it to the cloud in seconds. |
| **Docker** | Containerization | Packages our backend code and dependencies into a single container so it runs identically on local laptops and the cloud. |

